  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan turns into a divination tortoise and charges into Immortal Yan Huang’s lava battlefield, Xia Qing Cang tells him to taste the killer move scattering mind. It is a wisdom path immortal killer move and Xia Qing Cang’s signature method. Any Gu Immortal hit feels their mind wandering, with random thoughts colliding so battle strength falls; carelessness can leave them confused and unable to help themselves. The move hits Fang Yuan, dissipates, and leaves him unscathed because the divination tortoise counters wisdom path deduction methods, and Xia Qing Cang recognizes that this killer move was built from deduction concepts.",
